  <trk>
    <name>615 Biketicket to ride blue</name>
    <desc>For recreational bikers and families, this scenic round route starting at Piz Scalottas guarantees lots of riding fun. With beautiful, gentle descents and few, easy climbs, this route is even passable with rigid bikes.</desc>
    <type>mountainbiking</type>
